238\135\162\11\227\133\247\21\231\144\162\10\239\152\231\88","\226\130\121\134"),"The Cambrian explosion wasn't an explosion! It was very slow! Slightly disappointing! Still cool though!","T. rex teeth were like bananas! Not the taste! The— nevermind. Bananas.",v7("\172\48\205\116\155\56\214\105\155\121\212\126\154\60\131\122\154\54\214\117\140\121\197\116\154\121\194\59\128\44\205\127\154\60\199\59\137\55\199\59\155\48\219\111\145\116\197\114\158\60\131\118\129\53\207\114\135\55\131\98\141\56\209\104\201\121\241\116\157\62\203\119\145\120\131\82\200\43\204\110\134\61\131\127\135\46\205\59\156\54\131\121\141\121\208\122\142\60\130","\27\232\89\163"),"People thought the Stegosaurus had a second brain! It didn't! That rumour got around!",v7("\221\233\193\207\228\161\193\193\241\189\201\217\241\173\128\206\237\233\198\204\231\186\201\207\180\170\207\207\248\172\195\215\253\166\206\130\180\157\200\198\250\233\233\131\242\166\213\205\240\233\193\131\250\172\215\131\242\166\211\208\253\165\128\194\250\173\128\209\225\160\206\198\240\233\212\203\241\233\215\203\251\165\197\131\231\176\211\215\241\164\129","\163\148\201\160"),"I've been cleaning this fossil for three days! It's not even my fossil! It's a practice fossil!",v7("\122\140\236\166\164\10\75\197\227\232\178\18\30\135\225\244\185\22\30\132\250\227\253\17\91\134\224\232\180\6\95\137\228\255\253\1\87\139\231\245\188\16\76\150\183\166\137\0\93\141\230\239\190\4\82\137\241\167\253\44\30\150\233\255\253\12\74\197\233\166\177\10\74\196\168\213\178\23\76\156\169","\101\62\229\136\134\221"),"I know way too much about extinction! It's a conversation killer! Literally! Haha.","I have a favourite dinosaur but it changes! Every week! Currently it's a secret!",v7("\69\2\225\231\31\102\16\182\192\22\62\15\248\224\10\122\70\248\232\80\50\102\182\248\31\97\15\252\250\13\102\15\226\231\23\124\68\255\225\25\50\78\244\224\11\102\15\226\231\27\50\108\228\234\10\115\76\243\224\11\97\1\182\193\17\96\66\247\227\94\102\71\255\225\25\97\14","\126\18\47\150\143"),"This is going well! I think! I don't have data! But I feel it!",v7("\155\193\199\61\114\80\95\185\207\203\116\59\127\26\245\142\225\60\62\126\9\177\142\197\125\49\121\22\186\203\219\61\114\70\26\184\194\132\60\27\49\19\187\216\205\60\52\120\17\189\221\192\117\60\118\95\160\198\205\113\115","\127\212\174\168\28\82\17"),"If a twisted shows up, shout! I'll come running! I'll try to run fast!",v7("\41\162\89\212\1\234\69\216\31\184\28\196\30\171\81\222\4\171\29\151\35\234\75\216\24\184\69\151\11\168\83\194\30\234\85\195\75\234\117\151\29\165\78\197\19\234\93\213\5\191\72\151\7\163\82\210\74\190\83\216\70\234\84\216\4\175\79\195\6\179\18","\183\106\202\60"),"Stamina is not my strongest stat! I know that! I've read my own numbers!","My ability boosts extraction by seventy-five percent for fifteen seconds! I'm telling you in case you— need it!",v7("\115\98\250\75\201\19\66\73\45\178\71\222\24\27\26\49\254\67\219\19\17\26\48\247\75\219\15\67\26\12\253\72\208\18\27\26\42\243\89\159\19\20\95\48\178\75\204\29\7\94\98\230\69\159\5\7\95\98\230\66\218\86\17\86\43\246\79\204\88","\98\58\66\146\42\191\118"),"I'm not scared, I'm just— aware! Highly aware! Of the hallway!",v7("\161\230\121\202\85\142\220\136\255\115\202\12\199\201\196\242\125\203\69\205\219\136\252\101\152\77\142\222\141\247\60\203\69\218\223\197\176\89\213\92\218\195\200\176\120\205\95\218\195\200\176\115\219\79\207\201\141\255\114\217\64\194\195\196\244\125\214\75\203\200\139\229\111\153\12\228\207\151\228\60\212\69\197\223\196\244\117\223\95\143","\186\228\144\28\184\44\174"),"Pterosaurs are not dinosaurs! I will not elaborate! Okay, I'll elaborate later!",v7("\47\94\9\19\17\27\30\86\18\22\19\5\70\14\27\2\5\22\90\27\31\13\31\26\0\95\90\34\14\12\31\19\70\31\14\2\3\19\10\2\21\95\90\34\14\27\90\2\14\23\8\18\70\17\20\19\70\22\31\26\2\95","\118\102\126\122"),"I'm learning to sew! From a friend! It's going! It's going okay!","Nobody's listening and that's— fine! Totally fine! I'll just keep talking!",v7("\248\4\200\254\167\201\75\141\241\173\206\75\142\226\173\208\75\129\233\190\213\24\129\229\164\217\84\200\201\167\131\75\167\236\169\197\74\200\192\186\217\10\156\166\232\242\4\154\234\169\208\74","\200\188\107\232\135"),v7("\5\188\166\78\47\191\56\244\160\95\123\254\108\240\174\95\117\177\98\188\169\74\51\254\36\253\239\5\117","\159\76\156\193\43\91"),"Nevermind— it was never fun anyway! Kidding! Mostly!","If I go quiet, I'm counting exits. Two of them. Probably three.","Small steps! Big machine! That's the entire trick!","You're doing great! I mean it! I analyzed nothing but I mean it!",v7("\80\108\6\116\179\76\3\235\57\56\6\112\170\91\90\170\109\36\15\97\229\76\85\239\107\53\26\125\172\71\68\170\113\41\28\112\229\64\80\170\120\108\12\124\177\9\76\252\124\62\13\122\170\66\70\238\56\108\61\101\172\91\74\254\108\45\2\121\188\8","\138\25\76\110\21\197\41\35"),"There's dust on my shell! From the dig site! The digging is imaginary!",v7("\103\188\38\71\57\68\174\75\248\114\90\62\20\176\65\232\58\92\62\83\255\14\213\38\21\56\85\174\94\249\60\70\113\20\147\65\234\59\91\55\20\177\64\189","\222\46\156\82\53\80\52"),"I'm behind you! In a support way! Not a creepy way!","Two hands on the machine! Metaphorically! I'm not making it weird!","I could talk about the Mesozoic for an hour! I'll spare you! This time!","If you're bored, I can be boring quieter! I have that setting!","I brought a spare patch kit! It's never useful! It's never not useful!","It's quiet! I like quiet! I'm going to keep talking over it!",v7("\18\144\8\250\123\47\213\95\236\123\44\222\95\233\52\61\209\28\252\52\58\222\27\168\96\51\213\17\168\120\52\195\11\168\96\51\213\95\248\117\43\213\13\169\52\23\223\12\252\52\47\223\95\224\125\40\196\16\250\109\122\144\43\250\117\60\217\28\169","\20\91\176\127\136"),v7("\216\248\105\229\57\171\229\226\49\228\74\141\183\231\41\182\74\169\254\252\45\182\74\165\224\241\49\228\74\141\249\176\60\173\15\228\212\226\45\177\11\167\242\255\61\182\75\228\218\245\38\177\11\168\251\233\105","\196\151\144\72\197\106"),"Are we doing well? I think we're doing well! No data! But yes!","I'd rather dig than fight! Honestly I'd rather neither!","Nobody picks me first! That's fine! It's fine. It's— it's fine.","I'm a mollusk, technically! With hobbies! With a patch kit!","A brachiosaurus neck is longer than— a lot of things! That's a fact!","I keep thinking someone's about to say my name! Awkward!"},[v7("\60\235\161\96\32\241\172\125\39\250","\50\116\174\224")]={"Oh no— are you alright? Answer honestly! I'll wait right here!","Please, please, please don't panic! I know that's not how panic works! Please anyway!","Okay! New plan! Slower! Smaller steps! I'll stop saying calm!","That was one heart! That's— that's a lot! Come stand over here with me!","Please don't cry! I know you're not crying! I'm preemptively saying it!","I should have said something sooner! I'm sorry! I noticed the corner!","Ouch! New plan! The old plan was bad! I'm sorry, old plan!","Careful! One more of those is not a joke! I'm not joking around about it!",v7("\247\106\5\198\21\205\208\56\6\206\19\214\193\57\64\234\0\198\221\113\14\194\65\201\212\108\5\213\64\133\247\106\5\198\21\205\220\118\7\135\8\214\149\108\8\194\65\213\199\113\15\213\8\209\204\56\6\194\0\209\192\106\5\134","\165\181\24\96\167\97"),v7("\133\109\58\65\160\57\124\80\164\44\40\4\170\63\51\73\236\34\42\65\190\109\52\65\190\40\125\4\141\63\57\4\181\34\41\4\163\38\61\93\243\109\5\75\185\109\63\69\162\109\47\69\181\109\50\75\237","\36\204\77\92"),"Don't worry about looking scared! I look scared constantly! It's fine!","That's the floor being unfair, not you! I have evidence! My feelings!","You need to run? Run! Nobody's judging! I'm certainly not!","I'm hovering! This is a hovering! It's supportive!","New deal! I go in front for a little bit! I'll be brave in bursts!","Half a heart left! I'm going to worry loudly! Just ignore it!","I'm recalculating! Hold on! ...Recalculated! Stay near me!","Hahaha— that was scary! I'm fine! Are you fine? Please be fine!"},[v7("\12\102\9\248\62\23\115\30\240","\97\94\39\91\189")]={"OH! A medkit! Grab it! That's such a good find!","Bandage! Put it somewhere safe! Actually— use it if you need it! Both!","Good pickup! That's heart insurance! That's a real term! Probably!","One of those! I always get excited about those! Sorry! I'm not sorry!","That's worth more than most things on this floor! I have a ranking!","Keep that on you! I mean it! I'll ask about it later!","Rare find! That's— that's lucky! Don't waste it on me though!","I'd have walked right past that! I do that constantly!","Finally! Medical supplies! I've been mentally preparing for this!",v7("\1\121\250\2\228\17\246\32\125\255\86\166\23\185\33\121\254\86\160\27\255\51\116\233\19\170\17\252\116\49\200\25\228\2\245\48\112\232\19\229\82\218\52\99\254\16\177\30\245\44\48","\153\85\17\155\118\196\114")},[v7("\238\193\254\234","\81\167\149\187\167\219")]={"Ooo! Loot! That's— that's the technical term!",v7("\202\3\37\196\230\241\5\38\198\178\234\4\33\207\235\184\76\15\211\243\251\76\33\213\179\185\60\58\192\241\237\5\43\196\178\234\13\46\196\178\254\30\41\195\240\240\2\47\128","\146\153\108\72\161"),"A trinket! Or a thing! I don't know the taxonomy of everything!","Every item helps! Every single one! That's not a fact but it sounds right!",v7("\44\7\173\243\35\58\42\69\1\254\226\45\46\50\90\84\196\243\107\55\49\10\31\254\167\62\40\59\3\1\225\166\107\30\40\0\6\244\243\35\50\48\2\84\225\232\36\48\45\69\1\254\226\45\46\50\69\0\226\167\38\62\127","\94\101\116\141\135\75\91"),"I'll hold it if your hands are full! Metaphorically! Not physically!","Nice find! I'd clap but I'm using my hands for moral support!","Ooh, that one! Yes! That! I don't know what it does! But yes!","Into the bag! Into the— the slots! Whatever they're called!","That's more useful than my facts! Slightly more useful! Okay, a lot!"},[v7("\19\130\42\232\108\207\214","\118\82\192\99\164\37\155\143")]={"Let's do this!",v7("\27\180\94\111\33\186\69\111\38\180\11\59\42\178\88\110\98\146\11\34\39\186\69\111\43\175\10","\79\66\219\43"),"I'm here for you! Right here! Physically here!","Teamwork make the dream work! Wait— says teamwork make the dream work! I said it wrong! Moving on!","Inspiration! That's my whole thing! Seventy-five percent for fifteen seconds! Go!",v7("\59\65\224\5\24\82\179\31\18\87\178\81\59\73\253\24\14\72\179\24\9\0\241\20\27\79\225\20\93\105\179\22\24\84\179\2\21\89\179\16\26\65\250\31\92","\113\125\32\147"),"Go go go! I gave you a boost! Use it while it's warm!","That's my one trick! I do it well though!","Don't waste it on a hallway! Please! Hallways don't need inspiration!","Feeling braver? I passed some along! It's borrowed! Give it back later!","One small push! That's all I can give! It's a sincere push!","I picked you on purpose! Don't mention it! No, actually, mention it!",v7("\254\221\198\80\95\167\156\199\217\2\11\145\196\198\219\66\72\160\213\221\199\3\94\164\157\146\228\76\89\181\208\215\137\86\91\245\156\230\222\76\11\187\218\146\221\75\68\167\217\146\200\81\78\244\211\212\207\74\72\189\221\222\136","\212\188\178\169\35\43"),"I'm putting my whole shell into this one!"},[v7("\147\202\94\2\151\197\88","\74\222\139\29")]={"Finished as fast as a Gallimimus! That's canon! I said it right!","What a historical event! I'm putting those on the record!","I'm trying my best! And it worked! Look at it!","One machine down! I'm not extinct yet!",v7("\115\205\168\16\226\31\119\230\83\133\171\1\182\28\119\250\7\209\161\5\172\72\91\168\66\221\185\1\161\28\119\236\6\133\128\68\167\16\98\237\68\209\172\0\226\10\115\236\75\220\232","\136\39\165\201\100\194\104\18"),v7("\64\234\73\41\147\213\59\215\114\235\85\54\209\227\46\198\96\175\74\119\192\242\110\146\64\255\73\117\218\224\38\209\114\227\64\111\147\224\32\192\51\226\73\55\147\213\59\215\114\235\85\54\218\245\111\211\127\227\12\95\147\238\46\196\118\174","\178\19\143\44\22\179\134\79"),"Another one! I could do this al